  "answer_text": "The next NBA game is **Game 3 of the 2026 NBA Finals**, featuring the **San Antonio Spurs** and the **New York Knicks**. \n\n* **When:** Monday, June 8, 2026, at 8:30 PM ET\n* **Where:** Madison Square Garden (MSG) in New York City\n\nBecause this is a high-demand championship event, primary-sale tickets are almost certainly sold out at face value, but you can secure tickets through several verified online platforms:\n\n### 1. Official Primary Ticketing Partners\n* **Ticketmaster:** The official ticketing partner of the NBA, Madison Square Garden, and the New York Knicks. You can find primary tickets (if any remain) and **Ticketmaster Verified Resale** tickets directly on their platform.\n* **Knicks.com or MSG.com:** You can go directly to the Knicks' official website or Madison Square Garden's ticketing hub, which will redirect you to secure, verified links. \n\n### 2. Secondary Ticket Marketplaces (Resale)\nIf you are looking for secondary options, several reliable ticket search engines offer buyer guarantees:\n* **SeatGeek:** The official fan-to-fan ticket marketplace of the NBA.\n* **StubHub:** One of the largest ticket search engines, widely used for major sporting events like the Finals.\n* **Vivid Seats:** A reliable resale alternative with a 100% buyer guarantee.\n* **TickPick:** A great option if you want to avoid hidden \"service fees\" at checkout, as they show all-in pricing.\n* **Gametime:** Ideal if you are looking to track ticket prices and grab last-minute tickets leading right up to tip-off.\n\n### 3. In-Person at the Box Office\n* **Madison Square Garden Box Office:** Located in Chase Square. It is open Monday through Saturday from 12:00 PM to 6:00 PM, and on game days, it remains open until one hour after the game starts. \n* *Note:* Keep in mind that MSG utilizes strictly **mobile/digital ticketing**. Buying in person for an NBA Finals game is not recommended, as you'll likely still be prompted to buy or receive your tickets digitally, and availability will be highly limited.",
